// First-contact Nate/Xzor scene is initiated by Xzor's own script in range.
// Once dialogue sets QRH_XZOR_FIGHT to 1, the pair becomes hostile.
// Larissa's brewing location, Hannibal's compound and Thylion's future rewards
// remain unimplemented beyond their present quest starts, intentionally.


